# .gitattributes 基线。复制为仓库根目录 .gitattributes,避免跨平台换行噪音。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 工具链与脚本保留 CRLF
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj.filters text eol=crlf

# 二进制,禁止自动换行与 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.pdf binary
*.o binary
*.obj binary
*.lib binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
